WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:17.487
It’s project time! Build an interactive art gallery: at least two artist sprites, each drawing a different pattern when clicked — one with a nested loop, one with a growing variable — using colours chosen on purpose.

2
00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:21.496
Create at least two different patterns.

3
00:00:21.496 --> 00:00:28.383
One should use a nested loop, and one should use a variable that grows.

4
00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:32.226
Clicking a sprite draws a new pattern.

5
00:00:32.826 --> 00:00:37.104
Choose colours, pen sizes and angles on purpose.

6
00:00:37.104 --> 00:00:43.122
Small changes to numbers make big changes to the art — experiment!

7
00:00:43.722 --> 00:00:50.609
Give your artist sprites click scripts so visitors can choose which pattern to see.

8
00:00:51.209 --> 00:00:54.183
Real artists explain their work.

9
00:00:54.183 --> 00:01:00.635
In your reflection, say which numbers you changed and what effect they had.

10
00:01:01.235 --> 00:01:05.078
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:01:05.078 --> 00:01:10.226
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
